    contain logs, so the result depends on the initial state of
    expansion:

    >>> eq = (2 + 3*I)*log(x)
    >>> logcombine(eq, force=True) == eq
    True
    >>> logcombine(eq.expand(), force=True)
    log(x**2) + I*log(x**3)

